---
description: SEO requirements for every indexable page
globs: src/pages/**/*.astro,src/layouts/**/*.astro,src/data/tools.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

- One H1, unique title (<60 chars) and meta description (<155).
- Self-referencing canonical via `BaseLayout` / `ToolLayout` (workers.dev or custom domain — never `example.com`).
- `og:image` absolute URL must not end with `/`.
- Tool pages: converter above the fold; 600+ words of real content in `tools.ts`.
- JSON-LD must match visible content; no fake ratings.
- Follow `docs/KEYWORD-MAP.md` — no duplicate primary intent.
- Governing playbook: `docs/SEO-PLAYBOOK.md`. Hard indexing rules: `docs/SEO-GUARDRAILS.md`.
